  "contract": {
    "starting_clothes": "Current selected race/class baseline in native paperdoll slot; emit a separate Some(starter ID) action only for a nonzero baseline item. Hidden is always Some(0); worn is None.",
    "mutation": "Admitted Look actions directly replace that optional cosmetic lane, preserve other lanes, publish current class row to account setter and Gear request. Getter independently accepts exact requested-race/class starter cosmetics without collection membership.",
    "showing": "The positive override footer uses faction projection and generic metadata, which dispatches ordinary IDs to starter descriptor. Label uses starter.ID with static record fallback; starter quality0 chooses RGB0.91 alpha1."
  },
  "limits": [
    "Static current byte/data extraction and bounded native instruction replay; no original/rebuilt application, compiler, client, OS save or UI/render/input scheduling execution.",
    "Existing look viewport/parent proof is referenced canonically rather than duplicated. New current queries preserve raw-range ABI and external-signature limits.",
    "Generic item construction outside the ordinary starter branch, complete locale-loader execution, complete save parser/formatter, broader source systems and original/rebuilt parity are not certified."
  ],
